@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083/fhir/r4
@runId = replace-with-fresh-id

### Create source (201 for a fresh runId)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Patient/{{runId}}-source
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Prefer: return=representation

{"resourceType":"Patient","id":"{{runId}}-source","active":true,"identifier":[{"system":"urn:example:merge","value":"{{runId}}-source"}]}

### Create target
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Patient/{{runId}}-target
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Prefer: return=representation

{"resourceType":"Patient","id":"{{runId}}-target","active":true,"identifier":[{"system":"urn:example:merge","value":"{{runId}}-target"}]}

### Preview (200 Parameters; no stored version changes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Patient/$merge
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{"resourceType":"Parameters","parameter":[{"name":"source-patient","valueReference":{"reference":"Patient/{{runId}}-source"}},{"name":"target-patient","valueReference":{"reference":"Patient/{{runId}}-target"}},{"name":"preview","valueBoolean":true}]}

### Commit (200; both Patients become version 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Patient/$merge
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{"resourceType":"Parameters","parameter":[{"name":"source-patient","valueReference":{"reference":"Patient/{{runId}}-source"}},{"name":"target-patient","valueReference":{"reference":"Patient/{{runId}}-target"}}]}

### Patch target in transaction (200 transaction-response; target version 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/fhir+json
Prefer: return=representation

{"resourceType":"Bundle","type":"transaction","entry":[{"request":{"method":"PATCH","url":"Patient/{{runId}}-target","ifMatch":"W/\"2\""},"resource":{"resourceType":"Parameters","parameter":[{"name":"operation","part":[{"name":"type","valueCode":"replace"},{"name":"path","valueString":"Patient.active"},{"name":"value","valueBoolean":false}]}]}}]}

### Read-back: active=false, both identifiers, replaces link, version 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/Patient/{{runId}}-target
Accept: application/fhir+json

### Merged source $everything (400; follow replaced-by)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Patient/{{runId}}-source/$everything
Accept: application/fhir+json
